Subject: [PATCH 06/25] IbashoAgent streamUI: draw my UI but nobody else's
 words (for showing the window to others)

While on, LLFloater::setVisible (one hook in llfloater.cpp) vetoes chat and IM floaters, nearby
chat toasts from anyone but me, IM toasts, and notifications from or about people (offers, group
notices, friendship, payments, online/offline...; by type, canLogToIM and a name list). A
per-frame sweep catches anything visible some other way and keeps focus out of held floaters.
Chat bubbles off meanwhile. Held floaters reappear when it goes off. Modal dialogs always show.
